5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure whatever we choose is sustainable and won't fall apart after the first year. I'll look into the board minutes and the nursing round.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree that sustainability is key, but I am more concerned with actual patient outcomes. I'll check the readmission figures and the booking system records.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'm worried about the staff who will actually have to run these programs. I'll look into the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,A logical approach requires knowing the actual budget and the potential for revenue. I'll examine the development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see you all. I just want to ensure our facilities can handle more traffic. I will look into the rooms, parking, and shuttle coverage, and the booking system.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
