56,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. While A has merit, D is the most feasible.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Misaki,,I vote for D. The staffing slack in midwifery makes it the only viable option.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
